 ## Unreleased
 
+- New transactions are appended to the transactions file instead of rewriting it sorted
+  by date; the file is now kept in the order transactions were added.
 - Fixed amounts such as `19.99` being stored a cent short; an amount with more than two
   decimal places is now refused with `invalid amount` instead of being cut short.
 - Month files are written as format 2: every amount is a decimal string such as `"382.10"`
